<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.25;color:#0a0a0a;">
  Products need restocking
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5ba60b;">
  Inventory reminder
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  The following {{productCount}} product(s) at <strong>{{warehouseName}}</strong> still need attention. Review stock levels and restock when you can.
</p>

{{#> details}}
  {{> detail-row label="Warehouse" value=warehouseName}}
{{/details}}

<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#0a0a0a;">
  Products
</p>
<ul style="margin:0 0 20px;padding-left:20px;color:#2a2a2a;">
  {{#each products}}
  <li style="margin:0 0 6px;"><strong>{{this}}</strong></li>
  {{/each}}
</ul>

{{#> tip title="Next step"}}
  After you increase stock, Dukka clears the reminder flag so a new notice can be sent if levels drop again.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  This reminder was sent once per pending inventory row until stock is updated.
</p>
